<title>POLAND: Kruszwica Q1 net falls to PLN 0.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Kruszwica Q1 net falls to PLN 0.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kruszwica SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.55   vs   18.63</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.85   vs   12.63</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.69   vs    6.27</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales			    128.78   vs  140.04</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     109.84   vs  116.45</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.16   vs    5.34</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    1.02</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.21   vs    0.22</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.91   vs    6.21</p>
<p>    investment			    10.34   vs   11.33</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
